{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"SPRITE LOAD 1, \u0022Graphics/hero.png\u0022\n    SPRITE POS 1, 160, 120\n    SPRITE ALPHA 1, 0          ; B\u00F6rja osynlig\n    SPRITE ON 1\n    SPRITE FADE 1, 255, 120     ; Fade in p\u00E5 120 frames (~2 sek vid 60fps)\n\nMainLoop:\n    IF FADING(1) = 0 THEN\n        ; Spriten \u00E4r helt synlig \u2014 k\u00F6r spelet\n        IF KEYSTATE(\u0022Space\u0022) = 1 THEN\n            SPRITE FADE 1, 0, 20   ; Snabb fade ut (0.33 sek)\n        ENDIF\n    ENDIF\n\n    WAIT VBL                   ; TickSpriteFades() k\u00F6rs automatiskt h\u00E4r\nGOTO MainLoop","ScreenWidth":null,"ScreenHeight":null,"Sprites":null,"MapWidth":null,"MapHeight":null,"MapData":null}